{
  "evidenceCount": 27,
  "evidenceSpans": [
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-50328449",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0001",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "为完善跨境担保外汇管理，规范跨境担保项下收支行为，促进跨境担保业务健康有序发展，根据《中华人民共和国物权法》、《中华人民共和国担保法》及《中华人民共和国外汇管理条例》等法律法规，特制定本规定。",
      "quoteHash": "50328449cbad24cfaad2b83ee982076b238529337af808759b75b6a2f3c9400b",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-74cf36d9",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0002",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本规定所称的跨境担保是指担保人向债权人书面作出的、具有法律约束力、承诺按照担保合同约定履行相关付款义务并可能产生资金跨境收付或资产所有权跨境转移等国际收支交易的担保行为。",
      "quoteHash": "74cf36d9ee16e1c53c110f6b50986ad4dde6dbaab5e2f645cb545232bb1da53b",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-a29212cd",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0005",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "境内机构提供或接受跨境担保，应当遵守国家法律法规和行业主管部门的规定，并按本规定办理相关外汇管理手续。",
      "quoteHash": "a29212cdeefc6b936ad03c3755a89e0e9f9a925692d19fcf3983502e77d5415c",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-06018d3a",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0007",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "境内机构提供或接受其他形式跨境担保，应符合相关外汇管理规定。",
      "quoteHash": "06018d3aa4383e65c1c3574003ea7f46079cc40005d59d7f572acc6233bcf31a",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-991e1ba4",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0008",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "担保人办理内保外贷业务，在遵守国家法律法规、行业主管部门规定及外汇管理规定的前提下，可自行签订内保外贷合同。",
      "quoteHash": "991e1ba4e10deb7e57b524ccf95b1869aa8a22da732892e2a1a728aaabd5839d",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-60c930f3",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0009",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "担保人签订内保外贷合同后，应按以下规定办理内保外贷登记。",
      "quoteHash": "60c930f3be04301b3f633adc0cafbebe6470c7a6716aac09aa55ca4413f4a0f6",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-d662ad77",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0010",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行、非银行金融机构作为担保人提供内保外贷，按照行业主管部门规定，应具有相应担保业务经营资格。",
      "quoteHash": "d662ad77341abece6c1f46b791d61acd39b2ad379f9144674541376d08bdc860",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-0b88bbd9",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0011",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "内保外贷项下资金用途应当符合以下规定：",
      "quoteHash": "0b88bbd975b054610e2a9efda50a1b51b2e6885994de7335524d696b0c80d294",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-7e0a63e8",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0012",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "担保人办理内保外贷业务时，应对债务人主体资格、担保项下资金用途、预计的还款资金来源、担保履约的可能性及相关交易背景进行审核，对是否符合境内外相关法律法规进行尽职调查，并以适当方式监督债务人按照其申明的用途使用担保项下资金。",
      "quoteHash": "7e0a63e8f9d3c7ccac5617f21de392d34af47f61c910f1336f61df48e6ad0a60",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-1532cf3a",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0013",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "内保外贷项下担保人付款责任到期、债务人清偿担保项下债务或发生担保履约后，担保人应办理内保外贷登记注销手续。",
      "quoteHash": "1532cf3ade76a14cabfc0e35338923c35078d7cdcd8e6066ded7d6689d5260ee",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-2cc604f3",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0014",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "如发生内保外贷履约，担保人为银行的，可自行办理担保履约项下对外支付。",
      "quoteHash": "2cc604f3b0e719815806689ca78f2c17c6a8b0198a26395f469c8f98e8c97581",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-5cc60360",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0015",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "内保外贷业务发生担保履约的，成为对外债权人的境内担保人或反担保人应当按规定办理对外债权登记手续。",
      "quoteHash": "5cc60360c8644100af41b65968acd6d0801710671f929234aba04eb8f725f223",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-5d783249",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0016",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "境内个人可作为担保人并参照非银行机构办理内保外贷业务。",
      "quoteHash": "5d783249d338f53576822e5de009c9989a823dfde0de680979fbafb091d3596d",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-5f1bc86b",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0017",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "境内非金融机构从境内金融机构借用贷款或获得授信额度，在同时满足以下条件的前提下，可以接受境外机构或个人提供的担保，并自行签订外保内贷合同：",
      "quoteHash": "5f1bc86bf082f3b0928df680893411fe9801d6beb1ec5060f86b2942fe5727d4",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-40ca5659",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0018",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "境内债务人从事外保内贷业务，由发放贷款或提供授信额度的境内金融机构向外汇局集中报送外保内贷业务相关数据。",
      "quoteHash": "40ca5659e16aca8c1eded288a5dd697ef635095ebf04cc94d53047cf470deed7",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-6df8c433",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0019",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "外保内贷业务发生担保履约的，在境内债务人偿清其对境外担保人的债务之前，未经外汇局批准，境内债务人应暂停签订新的外保内贷合同；已经签订外保内贷合同但尚未提款或尚未全部提款的，未经所在地外汇局批准，境内债务人应暂停办理新的提款。",
      "quoteHash": "6df8c43339298809e59d97af7977fdefae252db88053911a13a45155ef1ca658",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-38040a61",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0020",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "外保内贷业务发生境外担保履约的，境内债务人应到所在地外汇局办理短期外债签约登记及相关信息备案手续。外汇局在外债签约登记环节对债务人外保内贷业务的合规性进行事后核查。",
      "quoteHash": "38040a61a9b3d4f18392473745696295e75b8cf06827225d675a5caa99a9309c",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
