        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-1c0e068b",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0021",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "外汇局不对担保当事各方设定担保物权的合法性进行审查。担保当事各方应自行确认担保合同内容符合境内外相关法律法规和行业主管部门的规定。",
      "quoteHash": "1c0e068b7a16ab6d6dc55825dd7fcdeead51d70920f9dba5a0faba0217cb755a",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-51b9fbeb",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0022",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "担保人与债权人之间因提供抵押、质押等物权担保而产生的跨境收支和交易事项，已存在限制或程序性外汇管理规定的，应当符合规定。",
      "quoteHash": "51b9fbebfdabbf735252dc082063041857467f8d8593f3d7655210bbc8b7b1c7",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-525cf366",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0023",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "当担保人与债权人分属境内、境外，或担保物权登记地（或财产所在地、收益来源地）与担保人、债权人的任意一方分属境内、境外时，境内担保人或境内债权人应按下列规定办理相关外汇管理手续：",
      "quoteHash": "525cf366138cc6b48fab5429d1a5fc6df26fa2de66ed446f7f934fcba854358e",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-631e7fb6",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0024",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "担保人为第三方债务人向债权人提供物权担保，构成内保外贷或外保内贷的，应当按照内保外贷或外保内贷相关规定办理担保登记手续，并遵守相关规定。",
      "quoteHash": "631e7fb63f7620746ba656dbc4e17571c620b2d3d451608b9dab7700b46a16c8",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-b7126d55",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0025",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "境内机构提供或接受除内保外贷和外保内贷以外的其他形式跨境担保，在符合境内外法律法规和本规定的前提下，可自行签订跨境担保合同。除外汇局另有明确规定外，担保人、债务人不需要就其他形式跨境担保到外汇局办理登记或备案。",
      "quoteHash": "b7126d55e1508da378a2e4db9f2c5d5563c1c57b147d78f7975c688676b313f1",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-e898a327",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0026",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "境内债务人对外支付担保费，可按照服务贸易外汇管理有关规定直接向银行申请办理。",
      "quoteHash": "e898a327e29ffbfb8784d3b2e8d80af233c8c7dd4fffebd3192d8c05239e1918",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-890d31b3",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0028",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "担保人、债务人、债权人向境内银行申请办理与跨境担保相关的购付汇或收结汇业务时，境内银行应当对跨境担保交易的背景进行尽职审查，以确定该担保合同符合中国法律法规和本规定。",
      "quoteHash": "890d31b38c7fc44b3e6350d57ac88fb47d885db71bd3c556c44e8ea71c5ea97a",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-4aca5e9f",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0029",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "外汇局对跨境担保合同的核准、登记或备案情况以及本规定明确的其他管理事项与管理要求，不构成跨境担保合同的生效要件。",
      "quoteHash": "4aca5e9fa49719c9c2080dbe3d359c980aaab5df96e72c5de6e6c8cf0e59e707",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-7c566f97",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0031",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "外汇局对境内机构跨境担保业务进行核查和检查，担保当事各方、境内银行应按照外汇局要求提供相关资料。对未按本规定及相关规定办理跨境担保业务的，外汇局根据《中华人民共和国外汇管理条例》进行处罚。",
      "quoteHash": "7c566f97d84b54130e61e19246743298f12a94a1a04ce595dc653cbd238a7502",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "e2e87a3c0fcc3294de04c72e923439cec32d60a5bac6add4c7f0f5716d439b8d",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB002-20260922-e2e87a3c",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB002-18e1c52e",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB002-0033",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本规定由国家外汇管理局负责解释。",
      "quoteHash": "18e1c52e7a6e3b1e3838287b28754de44a5bd86fe9d69cd9bb9c4bf463bf1ec0",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
